{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8328db38-6009-8231-b009-026e02ee7a77",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:13:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:11:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport Utilities, water and sewer billing, this is Tony. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Nick Ricci. My water bill came and it says estimated. Estimated read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:11:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that means the meter wasn't read that cycle, so the bill is based on your past usage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I don't think anybody read it. Nobody's been by. And it's way high. Last year my winter bills were much lower. Like half."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Estimates can run high if the last real read was a heavier season, like summer. Once we get an actual read, it trues up and the next bill adjusts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I pay the high one now and get it back later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Basically it gets credited on the next bill. If you want, I can note the account and request a meter read. Can I get your name and the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nicholas Ricci. Just note it, request the read. Callback is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I've got it down. Zero-one-six-three at the end. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I'm leaving on a trip Wednesday. Early. How do I pay before I go without coming down to City Hall? Can I do it online, or is there a night thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pay online through the city website any hour, or there's a payment drop box outside City Hall for checks. You can also mail it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drop box is fine. Where's that, the Middletown office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, this is Newport. City Hall on Broadway. The box is right out front by the entrance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport. Right, sorry. Okay. Check, then. Put it in the box, put the account number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Account number and your name on the check, and it'll get posted. If you do it today or tomorrow you're safe before Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And the meter read, you'll send somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request now. They'll schedule it, might take a little bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Safe travels, Mr. Ricci. Take care."
    }
  ],
